{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-4-6", "id": "msg_vrtx_01RLCATEBen6d9aHYHiTWDLi", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Now let me validate the current source.md content against all criteria.\n\nCurrent content:\n```\nThe recent trend toward AI-generated code has garnered significant attention from industry observers and practitioners alike. Experts argue that these tools play a crucial role in enhancing developer productivity, while some critics argue that the quality of generated code could potentially be problematic.\n\nIt is important to note that the technology showcases both promise and peril. The landscape of AI-assisted development is evolving rapidly, and it could be argued that the implications are far-reaching. Additionally, the interplay between human creativity and machine efficiency highlights the intricate tapestry of modern software engineering.\n\nOrganizations that leverage these tools effectively will be well-positioned to navigate the evolving landscape. In order to achieve optimal outcomes, teams must foster a culture of responsible AI adoption, ensuring that the technology serves as a complement to human expertise rather than a replacement.\n\n\n```\n\nLet me do the full validation report, then write my rewritten version.\n\n**AI Pattern Scan:**\n\n1. Significance inflation: \"garnered significant attention\" - CRITICAL\n2. Vague attributions: \"industry observers\", \"Experts argue\", \"some critics argue\" - CRITICAL\n3. AI vocabulary: \"garnered\", \"crucial\", \"enhancing\", \"landscape\" (x2), \"interplay\", \"tapestry\", \"leverage\", \"navigate\", \"foster\", \"ensuring\", \"showcases\", \"Additionally\" - CRITICAL\n4. Superfluous hedging: \"could potentially\", \"could be argued\", \"It is important to note\" - CRITICAL\n5. Passive construction: \"will be well-positioned\" - CRITICAL\n6. Vague implications: \"far-reaching implications\", \"intricate tapestry\" - CRIT